am/apps/2192970/extras/de68a7779e644bb946cb2d45386eddd0.mp4?t=1770297632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic games included: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkers, Go, Chess, and Parchisi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French deck card games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find other players in our Discord or Telegram and start a session (no AI opponents yet).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All On Board! is made by an independent studio that loves board games as much as you do. It\u2019s built on passion, constant updates, and a growing lineup of great titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/d6cd6664c41d8c93b1d6df0d757d9879.poster.avif?t=1770297632\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/d6cd6664c41d8c93b1d6df0d757d9879.webm?t=1770297632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/d6cd6664c41d8c93b1d6df0d757d9879.mp4?t=1770297632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["The Game Kitchen"],"dlc":[3628130,3058460,3058470,3061340,3078860,3078880,3400410],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/f2aa35a4e13590fc33c801229deb99200ed8c1df/header.jpg?t=1770297632","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"